Notes specific to this codebase:
- Placing it after `sessionUser` gets `accountId` on every log line, useful given the missing account-scoping bugs already found.
- `res.on("finish")` logs actual outcome/status, not just the incoming request — catches the hang case from the dropped-connection bug too (though that case never fires `finish`, so add a `timeout`/`close` log line if visibility into hangs matters).
